### 8.2 Header utility panels
- WHEN the user activates “External Links” THEN THE SYSTEM SHALL show an overlay panel that includes a Close action extLinksCloseButton with visible text “Close”. [ctl:link-external-links, kit:extLinksCloseButton]
- WHEN the user activates “Messages” THEN THE SYSTEM SHALL show an overlay panel that includes a Close action messagesCloseButton with visible text “Close”. [ctl:link-messages, kit:messagesCloseButton]
- WHEN the user activates “Contact Us” THEN THE SYSTEM SHALL show an overlay panel that includes a Close action intPortalContactUsCloseButton with visible text “Close”. [ctl:link-contact-us, kit:intPortalContactUsCloseButton]

### 8.3 Scroll behavior
- WHEN the page is scrolled down past 150px THE SYSTEM SHALL hide the header and show it again when scrolling back up (Headroom behavior). [asset:kit/screen.json]

